# Nothing listed here is uploaded to the host.

# The moderation app is NOT a public surface. In production it sits behind
# Cloudflare Access or a tunnel; putting it on Vercel would publish the review
# queue with a shared token as the only thing in front of it.
moderation/

# Not needed to build or serve the site.
db/tests/
server/test/
docs/
*.tgz
*.md

# NOTE on what is deliberately NOT excluded:
#   server/ and db/migrations/ and db/seeds/ are required AT BUILD TIME.
#   `npm run build:review` starts an in-process Postgres, applies the real
#   migrations to it, loads the ward boundaries, and runs the batch publish to
#   produce web/build/data. Excluding them breaks the build.
#   They ship no runtime surface: the deployed output is static files only.
